#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-calc-occupancy.rst:2
msgid "llvm-calc-occupancy - AMDGPU occupancy calculator"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-calc-occupancy.rst:7
msgid "SYNOPSIS"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-calc-occupancy.rst:9
msgid ":program:`llvm-calc-occupancy` -mcpu=<gfxNNN> [*options*]"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-calc-occupancy.rst:12
msgid "DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-calc-occupancy.rst:14
msgid ""
":program:`llvm-calc-occupancy` reports the occupancy (waves per execution "
"unit) that an AMDGPU kernel would achieve for a given combination of "
"workgroup size, VGPR usage, SGPR usage and LDS allocation. It is a thin "
"front-end over the same occupancy math the AMDGPU backend uses "
"(``GCNSubtarget``), so the numbers match what the compiler computes for an "
"equivalent kernel."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-calc-occupancy.rst:20
msgid ""
"Any resource that is not specified is treated as unconstrained. When the "
"workgroup size is left unspecified (or given as a range), the occupancy is "
"reported as a range as well."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-calc-occupancy.rst:24
msgid ""
"The tool only supports the AMDGPU target. New callers should use the "
"``amdgpu`` triple (for example ``amdgpu-amd-amdhsa``); the legacy ``amdgcn`` "
"spelling is still accepted."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-calc-occupancy.rst:29
msgid "EXAMPLE"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-calc-occupancy.rst:55
msgid "OPTIONS"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-calc-occupancy.rst:59
msgid "Target GPU, for example ``gfx90a``. Required."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-calc-occupancy.rst:63
msgid ""
"Target triple. Defaults to ``amdgpu-amd-amdhsa``. Must be an AMDGPU triple "
"(the ``amdgpu`` or legacy ``amdgcn`` arch)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-calc-occupancy.rst:68
msgid ""
"Comma-separated list of subtarget features, for example ``+wavefrontsize32``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-calc-occupancy.rst:73
msgid ""
"Flat workgroup size. Accepts a single value ``N`` or a range ``MIN:MAX``. "
"When omitted, the full legal range is assumed and the occupancy is reported "
"as a range."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-calc-occupancy.rst:79
msgid ""
"Number of VGPRs used per lane. When omitted, VGPRs do not constrain the "
"occupancy."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-calc-occupancy.rst:84
msgid ""
"Number of SGPRs used per wave. When omitted, SGPRs do not constrain the "
"occupancy."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-calc-occupancy.rst:89
msgid ""
"LDS bytes allocated per workgroup. Accepts an optional ``k``/``kb`` or ``m``/"
"``mb`` suffix (base 1024)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-calc-occupancy.rst:94
msgid ""
"Dynamic VGPR block size. ``0`` (the default) disables dynamic VGPR mode."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-calc-occupancy.rst:98
msgid ""
"Print, for each occupancy level supported by the GPU, the maximum number of "
"VGPRs and SGPRs that still reaches that level."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-calc-occupancy.rst:103
msgid "Print a summary of command line options and exit."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-calc-occupancy.rst:106
msgid "EXIT STATUS"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-calc-occupancy.rst:108
msgid ""
":program:`llvm-calc-occupancy` returns 0 on success and a non-zero exit code "
"if the arguments are invalid (for example a missing or non-AMDGPU target)."
msgstr ""
